  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:068d2c0b5e713c3ea59c6f87cda57dc9b28fc549f351e3b6573d9810a08fdef8",
      "request_id": "068d2c0b5e713c3ea59c6f87cda57dc9b28fc549f351e3b6573d9810a08fdef8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5b8190e857e78aee4ddf6d92bc953a72",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，她拿到两个赛点，却没能拿下比赛。高芙完成逆转，她止步八强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1d4a7577eb81910c1a14bcb42879488db0cf006a4c102db0667cad3137561091",
      "words_sha256": "9adbc0c0446642d2c63bd8645b4af02a180ae3da4fa529c995a700dbba3803be"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:44d6435dfb7e81cfc73d603cf7677fb330ec05f4f47a63e96b5249d0a3f41fb8",
      "request_id": "44d6435dfb7e81cfc73d603cf7677fb330ec05f4f47a63e96b5249d0a3f41fb8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fed0665aae14806a629c6106fe1f530b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "去年错过单打年终，今年拿下第一座大满贯。安德烈耶娃终于拿到那张门票。但这一年，并不是一路赢过来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "00489b1df99413f97c90757e8c4fbe0ac3126e8c72c0b82f3ee0c1038909d619",
      "words_sha256": "b104b5efaf7886613091797635050674410a2e66a1d96a1ae0bb0e103e42d1a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:457ff689c486dbf9bd17e8cdb92d30d07528335a21512d92ab15a03ea2390178",
      "request_id": "457ff689c486dbf9bd17e8cdb92d30d07528335a21512d92ab15a03ea2390178",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d99d93a30afbd02d51c7dc605856b7ca",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "到了巴黎，她先在半决赛击败科斯秋克，再战胜赫瓦林斯卡。十九岁，首夺大满贯，她一直以来的梦想成为现实。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8a28fca2554d16c72a17a9982859cc032dc372e0b576b44059b9e834336dd286",
      "words_sha256": "982b90c739abe0f70952c788c66d183e9923cf12abe0d32cbb83ae38cf27ef5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5b2f942a11c25dcd44005360b1cf12523637b27e8579a75af101552edd322747",
      "request_id": "5b2f942a11c25dcd44005360b1cf12523637b27e8579a75af101552edd322747",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea105b47dc4881434600831c73f442b4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "本季至今，红土二十二胜三负，草地却只有一胜两负。温网先赢一盘，她仍被克雷吉茨科娃逆转。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "979ff65a231d2be8b5dbeea243b59329213956293a2d09ccf02fdc82ddd7eda9",
      "words_sha256": "90ea4d3fb7ff6acb59e051607588e114288918a27a16415e37fa53c8e6cf89fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:62506c105dbe6e7de2ee91dc9e3275c1d91d771101ef0f3a81ffd01163ef8c0b",
      "request_id": "62506c105dbe6e7de2ee91dc9e3275c1d91d771101ef0f3a81ffd01163ef8c0b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fe880d349630dcaded4bf7a102e1deed",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "阿德莱德决赛，她从零比三开始连赢九局，拿下赛季首冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e0b256c18ff6700a517e071bf613ba29f550cf846cd9d95e3eb9602903f770a5",
      "words_sha256": "d0feff8b7b299c860c37839404f2949dd6db6619c7361232a67e44a7df2ab7ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:671b7d2df79d75f7d3f64f27b63793c85d591332e979ccb0e4420216115698a0",
      "request_id": "671b7d2df79d75f7d3f64f27b63793c85d591332e979ccb0e4420216115698a0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "621c9c72ed31f3bb5f510f41d5618735",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "澳网止步第四轮。接下来的四站硬帝，她也都没能走到四强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e85f5d86ad6fffbd38e19123a4c009526123f2a0a5b18696abe18edbb43d9d66",
      "words_sha256": "976c4877dd8b32676e1df7cf40b96a238f772c0f1ed3d9424881da8d620b623e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6bf714242e833939885aee685d891efff948fda26f40378c72ee029415b36483",
      "request_id": "6bf714242e833939885aee685d891efff948fda26f40378c72ee029415b36483",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "fad5450e5b0f635667fa0c5014f1f8c4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "马德里再进决赛，却两盘负于科斯秋克。这一次，奖杯属于科斯秋克。可两人的故事，还没结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0dfb4386c2eebec55a028b191cfc447d464d63fb903e07a824cc281bd572d4be",
      "words_sha256": "1b187567b17d29ad24bf963c5bbca4016c72376d20ec9aa33bc097def15f2d4f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6c6b3fa8bdcf71bdb2a5f677dc8ab2ba256a6b67f0d46b74b51ae463e24875d5",
      "request_id": "6c6b3fa8bdcf71bdb2a5f677dc8ab2ba256a6b67f0d46b74b51ae463e24875d5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c1cbf72d2cf6354bc25d2c0d1c907651",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她回顾，今年和团队更注意参赛与休息。去年错过的单打年终门票，今年终于属于她。首次单打年终，你期待她走到哪一步？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fec3e45e6f338ed6c48c94d1d00ab2a3debc8e574a7972282215731191156e7e",
      "words_sha256": "8318b893b2bfa4c2d407d458243dfe16da27816fa25f010cc4d1fa6ab31b2d90"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8e7dd87e9e1019b259f4ce5d8899a41e4e5d7069c19ca818157f5765f285d612",
      "request_id": "8e7dd87e9e1019b259f4ce5d8899a41e4e5d7069c19ca818157f5765f285d612",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d72c814635f9053166106c7dcc334276",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月九日，官方确认她首次获得单打年终资格。去年错过的那张门票，今年不用再等到最后。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "6572f14c00f76b06612b8683b4a376ecc15195af11cc191e7921bb80ec4dd50d",
      "words_sha256": "bc4a4b6906d899385f1f224df258e9c75a3ae8677476b53cb5cadbd346a42ec8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b03811d74c3672e28238ad4c6ef8be8cd63e2224174ed2668cc7a1dc816f6c47",
      "request_id": "b03811d74c3672e28238ad4c6ef8be8cd63e2224174ed2668cc7a1dc816f6c47",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "000a7405699240f2022817a747dc5665",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两天后的北京决赛，五比七、四比六，她负于郑钦文，收获亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f42cb7a07502d762efa85bd35dcdc4fbcef9319502df9f779abdb70d9592d4f4",
      "words_sha256": "83becfa1163dc8095b9b82b910b20ffcb6ea49be1306736bf0db95a237f8463f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7a3a0a50808c47121774d198c34f84ccc9670bff740e06aacde9ed15be30987f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
